ualifiers":{"source_term":"子懿公赤","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本篇明示父、子、生、夫人與兄弟原稱，不由繼位推父子、不補同父同母或闕代；來源主張並非已確證史實。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji037-016","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_CA","title":"懿公","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p016","quote":"二十五年，惠公怨周之容舍黔牟，與燕伐周。周惠王奔温，衞、燕立惠王弟穨爲王。二十九年，鄭復納惠王。三十一年，惠公卒，子懿公赤立。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji037-016:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p016","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"懿公","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0058","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"侯、公及諡號等暫作敘事追稱，不把繼位當當時授予諡號；未知曆日與終點不按卒日補造。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji037-077","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_CA","surfaces":["懿公","懿公赤","衞懿公"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p016","quote":"二十五年，惠公怨周之容舍黔牟，與燕伐周。周惠王奔温，衞、燕立惠王弟穨爲王。二十九年，鄭復納惠王。三十一年，惠公卒，子懿公赤立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p017","quote":"懿公卽位，好鶴，淫樂奢侈。九年，翟伐衞，衞懿公欲發兵，兵或畔。大臣言曰：「君好鶴，鶴可令撃翟。」翟於是遂入，殺懿公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p018","quote":"懿公之立也，百姓大臣皆不服。自懿公父惠公朔之讒殺太子伋代立至於懿公，常欲敗之，卒滅惠公之後而更立黔牟之弟昭伯頑之子申爲君，是爲戴公。戴公申元年卒。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p020","quote":"初，翟殺懿公也，衞人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公爲君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申爲戴公。戴公卒，復立其弟燬爲文公。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與追稱、衛世系及具體事件暫定所列提及同指；每段原文附存，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"identity_distinctions":[{"id":"d-shiji037-distinct-010","person_ids":["qy1_adc_gam_CA","9w2_c77_53m_E"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p017","quote":"懿公卽位，好鶴，淫樂奢侈。九年，翟伐衞，衞懿公欲發兵，兵或畔。大臣言曰：「君好鶴，鶴可令撃翟。」翟於是遂入，殺懿公。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-037","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p023","quote":"成公三年，晉欲假道於衞救宋，成公不許。晉更從南河度，救宋。徴師於衞，衞大夫欲許，成公不肯。大夫元咺攻成公，成公出奔。晉文公重耳伐衞，分其地予宋，討前過無禮及不救宋患也。衞成公遂出奔陳。二歳，如周求入，與晉文公會。晉使人鴆衞成公，成公私於周主鴆，令薄，得不死。已而周爲請晉文公，卒入之衞，而誅元咺，衞君瑕出奔。七年，晉文公卒。十二年，成公朝晉襄公。十四年，秦穆公卒。二十六年，齊邴歜弒其君懿公。三十五年，成公卒，子穆公遫立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-037","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"}],"rationale":"衛懿公赤因翟亡，齊懿公在邴歜弒君記事，國別不同，不按同諡合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p016","text":"二十五年，惠公怨周之容舍黔牟，與燕伐周。周惠王奔温，衞、燕立惠王弟穨爲王。二十九年，鄭復納惠王。三十一年，惠公卒，子懿公赤立。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"黔牟","kind":"person","person_id":"78j_6yv_eaf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"周惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"穨","kind":"person","person_id":"gdy_039_7n5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m016-0058","start":58,"end":61,